tes of the vector $x$ relative to the basis $B={{b}_{1},{b}_{2}},$ where\n\n$$\n{b}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{b}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,x=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf $[x]_{B}=\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}$ then what is the value of ${x}_{2}?$" :question/worked-solution "Remember, the order of the vectors in a basis is important.\n\nNotice that \n\n$$\n\\underbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}}_{x}=\\underbrace{(\\,2\\,)}_{{x}_{1}}\\cdot \\underbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}}_{{b}_{1}}+\\underbrace{(\\,-4\\,)}_{{x}_{2}}\\cdot \\underbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}}_{{b}_{2}}\n$$\n\nwhich means that\n\n$$\nx=2\\cdot {b}_{1}+(-4)\\cdot {b}_{2}\n$$\n\nand therefore\n\n$$\n[x]_{B}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFinally, we have that ${x}_{2}=-4.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120526 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b54cb193-5d35-5cbe-b1a8-00c22eecc071" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186119271} {:answer/id #uuid "d5886953-6f29-5946-b180-ebd89e20045f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186119272} {:answer/id #uuid "dbc053e0-181b-55ef-9f1d-42ebfe313100" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186119273} {:answer/id #uuid "ec0798aa-5263-5682-b610-26e6ae197af1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186119274} {:answer/id #uuid "311f1461-3d01-55c5-a5ae-6aef0d189aa5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x ∉ Span{b_{1}, b_{2}, b_{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186119275}] :answer-field/id #uuid "fdcbb148-4995-58d7-